   <!-- ============ WHAT WE DO — embedded between price cards ============ -->\n    <div class=\"scope-strip\" id=\"producto\">\n      <div class=\"scope-tag\">\n        <span data-es>Lo que hacemos</span><span data-en>What we do</span><span data-ht>Sa nou fè</span>\n      </div>\n      <h3 class=\"scope-headline\">\n        <span data-es>Traducimos. Tecleamos. Enviamos.</span>\n        <span data-en>We translate. We type. We mail.</span><span data-ht>Nou tradui. Nou tape. Nou voye.</span>\n      </h3>\n      <p class=\"scope-lede\">\n        <span data-es>Eso es todo. Tres cosas. NO damos consejo legal. NO le decimos cuándo entregar. NO vamos a la corte. USTED decide. USTED firma. USTED entrega.</span>\n        <span data-en>That's it. Three things. We do NOT give legal advice. We do NOT tell you when to file. We do NOT go to court. YOU decide. YOU sign. YOU file.</span>\n        <span data-ht>Se sa. Twa bagay. Nou PA bay konsèy legal. Nou PA di w kilè pou depoze. Nou PA ale nan tribinal. OU deside. OU siyen. OU depoze.</span>\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"scope-pillars\">\n        <div class=\"scope-pillar\">\n          <div class=\"scope-pill-icon\">A</div>\n          <h4><span data-es>Traducir</span><span data-en>Translate</span><span data-ht>Tradui</span></h4>\n          <p>\n            <span data-es>Usted escribe sus respuestas en su idioma. Nosotros las traducimos al inglés. Palabra por palabra.</span>\n            <span data-en>You write your answers in your language. We translate them to English. Word for word.</span>\n            <span data-ht>Ou ekri repons ou yo nan lang ou. Nou tradui yo an Angle. Mo pa mo.</span>\n          </p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Spanish · Español</li>\n            <li>Haitian Creole · Kreyòl</li>\n            <li>English · Inglés</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"scope-pillar\">\n          <div class=\"scope-pill-icon\">B</div>\n          <h4><span data-es>Teclear</span><span data-en>Type</span><span data-ht>Tape</span></h4>\n          <p>\n            <span data-es>Tecleamos sus respuestas en el Formulario AO 242 (papel de la corte) y la exención de costos. Los dos formularios son GRATIS del gobierno.</span>\n            <span data-en>We type your answers onto Form AO 242 (the court paper) and the fee waiver. Both forms are FREE government forms.</span>\n            <span data-ht>Nou tape repons ou yo sou Fòm AO 242 (papye tribinal la) ak fòm pou egzansyon frè. Toude fòm yo GRATIS nan men gouvènman an.</span>\n          </p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Form AO 242 · 28 U.S.C. § 2241</li>\n            <li>IFP Fee-Waiver Application</li>\n            <li>Government-published forms</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"scope-pillar\">\n          <div class=\"scope-pill-icon\">C</div>\n          <h4><span data-es>Enviar</span><span data-en>Mail</span><span data-ht>Voye</span></h4>\n          <p>\n            <span data-es>Solo cuando USTED toca el botón enviamos el paquete. Mandamos sus papeles, formularios en blanco, ejemplos, y un sobre con estampilla. USTED firma. USTED entrega.</span>\n            <span data-en>We only mail the package when YOU press the button. We send your forms, blank copies, examples, and a stamped envelope. YOU sign. YOU file.</span>\n            <span data-ht>Sèlman lè OU peze bouton an nou voye pakè a. Nou voye papye w yo, fòm vid, egzanp, ak yon anvlòp ki gen tenm. OU siyen. OU depoze.</span>\n          </p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Pre-prepared package</li>\n            <li>Blank forms + samples</li>\n            <li>Prepaid return envelope</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"scope-footnote\">\n        <span data-es>Tres cosas. Nada más.</span>\n        <span data-en>Three things. Nothing else.</span>\n        <span data-ht>Twa bagay. Anyen lòt.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"price-card\">\n      <div class=\"price-tag\">\n        <span data-es>Próximamente fines de 2026</span>\n        <span data-en>Coming late 2026</span><span data-ht>K ap vini fen 2026</span>\n      </div>\n      <h3>\n        <span data-es>Proteger Sus Cosas</span>\n        <span data-en>Protect Your Things</span><span data-ht>Pwoteje Bagay Ou Yo</span>\n      </h3>\n      <div class=\"price-num-wrap\">\n        <span class=\"price-num\">+$99</span>\n        <span class=\"price-cents\">\n          <span data-es>+ $5/mes extra</span>\n          <span data-en>+ $5/mo extra</span><span data-ht>+ $5/mwa anplis</span>\n        </span>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"price-list\">\n        <li><span data-es>Formularios en blanco (carro, etc.) — USTED los llena y notariza</span><span data-en>Blank forms (car, etc.) — YOU fill them and notarize</span><span data-ht>Fòm vid (machin, elatriye) — OU ranpli yo ak notarize</span></li>\n        <li><span data-es>Carta de hardship — para los pagos de la casa y el carro</span><span data-en>Hardship letter — for your house and car payments</span><span data-ht>Lèt difikilte — pou peman kay ak machin</span></li>\n        <li><span data-es>Formulario para que alguien cuide a sus hijos en la escuela</span><span data-en>Form to let someone care for your kids at school</span><span data-ht>Fòm pou yon moun pran swen pitit ou nan lekòl</span></li>\n        <li><span data-es>Formulario para que alguien use su banco y pague cuentas</span><span data-en>Form for someone to use your bank and pay bills</span><span data-ht>Fòm pou yon moun sèvi ak labank ou ak peye bil</span></li>\n      </ul>\n      <a href=\"/checkout\" class=\"price-cta\" style=\"background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);\">\n        <span data-es>Avíseme cuando esté listo</span><span data-en>Tell me when ready</span><span data-ht>Di m lè li pare</span>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"price-fineprint\">\n    <span data-es>Los abogados de Florida cobran $4,500 a $5,500 por una audiencia de fianza. Cobran $8,500 a $15,000+ por papeles de la corte. Nuestro plan NO reemplaza a un abogado. Pone su caso ante un juez rápido. Pague una vez. Cancele cuando quiera.</span>\n    <span data-en>Florida lawyers charge $4,500 to $5,500 for a bond hearing. They charge $8,500 to $15,000+ for court papers. Our plan does NOT replace a lawyer. It gets your case in front of a judge fast. Pay once. Cancel any time.</span><span data-ht>Avoka Florid yo mande $4,500 a $5,500 pou yon odyans kosyon. Yo mande $8,500 a $15,000+ pou papye tribinal. Plan nou an PA ranplase yon avoka. Li mete ka w devan yon jij rapid. Peye yon fwa. Anile lè ou vle.</span>\n  </p>\n</section>\n\n<!-- SCOPE PULL-QUOTE (after FAQ) -->\n<section class=\"scope-quote\">\n  <div class=\"scope-marks\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <span class=\"scope-mark-l\">\"</span>\n    <span class=\"scope-mark-r\">\"</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"scope-inner reveal\">\n    <div class=\"section-tag\" style=\"margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--accent-deep);\">\n      <span data-es>El alcance de nuestro servicio</span>\n      <span data-en>The scope of our service</span><span data-ht>Limit sèvis nou an</span>\n    </div>\n    <blockquote>\n      <p data-es>Hay un solo documento para impugnar la detención ilegal pro se: la petición de habeas corpus bajo 28 U.S.C. § 2241. El propio formulario indica al usuario que dé \"hechos de respaldo\" solamente — \"sea breve, no cite casos ni la ley\".</p>\n      <p data-en>There is only one document to challenge unlawful detention pro se: the 28 U.S.C. § 2241 petition for writ of habeas corpus. The form itself instructs the user to give \"supporting facts\" only — \"be brief, do not cite cases or law.\"</p><p data-ht>Gen yon sèl dokiman pou konteste detansyon ilegal pro se: petisyon habeas corpus dapre 28 U.S.C. § 2241. Fòm nan li menm di itilizatè a pou bay \"faktè ki sipòte yo\" sèlman — \"fè kout, pa site ka oswa lalwa\".</p>\n    </blockquote>\n    <div class=\"scope-rule\"></div>\n    <div style=\"max-width: 44rem; margin: 0 auto 2rem; text-align: left; font-size: 0.98rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink-soft);\">\n      <p data-es style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Son respuestas de sí/no, fechas, lugares y casillas para marcar. Nuestro sistema le muestra el formulario y las instrucciones del secretario de la corte en su idioma, y luego teclea sus respuestas factuales y marca las casillas que <strong>USTED</strong> selecciona. El único otro documento que tocamos es la solicitud de exención de costos in forma pauperis, que funciona igual.</p>\n      <p data-en style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\">It is yes/no answers, dates, locations, and checkboxes. Our system shows you the form and the court clerk's instructions in your language, then types your factual answers and checks the boxes <strong>YOU</strong> select. The only other document we touch is the in forma pauperis fee-waiver application, which works the same way.</p><p data-ht style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Se repons wi/non, dat, kote, ak kazye pou tcheke. Sistèm nou an montre w fòm nan ak enstriksyon grefye tribinal la nan lang ou, epi li tape repons faktyèl ou yo epi tcheke kazye <strong>OU</strong> chwazi. Sèl lòt dokiman nou manyen se aplikasyon in forma pauperis pou egzansyon frè a, ki mache menm jan.</p>\n      <p data-es style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\"><strong>Si necesita preparar cualquier otro documento pro se, por favor use otro proveedor.</strong></p>\n      <p data-en style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\"><strong>If you need any other pro se document prepared, please use a different provider.</strong></p><p data-ht style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\"><strong>Si ou bezwen prepare nenpòt lòt dokiman pro se, tanpri sèvi ak yon lòt founisè.</strong></p>\n      <p data-es>No estamos disponibles por teléfono, correo, ni chat — el sistema funciona por sí solo, y no hay nadie a quien llamar para consejo.</p>\n      <p data-en>We are not available by phone, email, or chat — the system runs on its own, and there is no one to call for advice.</p><p data-ht>Nou pa disponib pa telefòn, imèl, ni chat — sistèm nan mache pou kont li, epi pa gen pèsòn pou rele pou konsèy.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"scope-attr\">\n      <span data-es>DetencionDefensa.com, Inc. · Acuerdo del cliente, §1</span>\n      <span data-en>DetencionDefensa.com, Inc. · Customer Agreement, §1</span><span data-ht>DetencionDefensa.com, Inc. · Akò Kliyan, §1</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- NOT A LAW FIRM PAGE -->\n<section class=\"not-law-firm\" id=\"not-law-firm\">\n  <div class=\"reveal\" style=\"max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n\n    <div class=\"nlf-stamp\">\n      <span data-es>NO somos un bufete de abogados</span>\n      <span data-en>NOT A LAW FIRM</span><span data-ht>PA yon kabinè avoka</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 class=\"nlf-title\">\n      <span data-es>Por qué <em>no somos</em> un servicio legal.</span>\n      <span data-en>Why we are <em>not</em> a legal service.</span><span data-ht>Poukisa nou <em>pa</em> yon sèvis legal.</span>\n    </h2>\n\n    <p class=\"nlf-lede\">\n      <span data-es>Esto importa. Importa para usted, importa para nosotros, e importa para la corte. Le explicamos en palabras sencillas qué hacemos, qué NO hacemos, y por qué la diferencia es real.</span>\n      <span data-en>This matters. It matters for you, it matters for us, and it matters for the court. Here is what we do, what we do NOT do, and why the difference is real — in plain words.</span><span data-ht>Sa enpòtan. Li enpòtan pou ou, li enpòtan pou nou, epi li enpòtan pou tribinal la. Men sa nou fè, sa nou PA fè, epi poukisa diferans lan reyèl — nan mo senp.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <!-- BINARY: WE DO / WE DO NOT -->\n    <div class=\"nlf-binary\">\n      <div class=\"nlf-col do\">\n        <div class=\"nlf-col-tag\">\n          <span data-es>Lo que SÍ hacemos</span><span data-en>What we DO</span><span data-ht>Sa nou FÈ</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3>\n          <span data-es>Tres cosas. Nada más.</span>\n          <span data-en>Three things. Nothing more.</span><span data-ht>Twa bagay. Anyen lòt.</span>\n        </h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li><span data-es>Traducimos sus respuestas factuales del español o creole al inglés.</span><span data-en>Translate your factual answers from Spanish or Creole into English.</span><span data-ht>Tradui repons faktyèl ou yo soti nan Panyòl oswa Kreyòl ale nan Angle.</span></li>\n          <li><span data-es>Tecleamos esas respuestas en el Formulario AO 242 (gratis del gobierno) y en la solicitud de exención de costos.</span><span data-en>Type those answers onto Form AO 242 (free government form) and the fee-waiver application.</span><span data-ht>Tape repons sa yo sou Fòm AO 242 (fòm gratis nan men gouvènman an) ak sou aplikasyon egzansyon frè a.</span></li>\n          <li><span data-es>Enviamos por correo el paquete preparado — solo si USTED toca el botón.</span><span data-en>Mail the prepared package — only if YOU press the button.</span><span data-ht>Voye pakè ki prepare a nan lapòs — sèlman si OU peze bouton an.</span></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"nlf-col dont\">\n        <div class=\"nlf-col-tag\">\n          <span data-es>Lo que NO hacemos</span><span data-en>What we DO NOT do</span><span data-ht>Sa nou PA fè</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3>\n          <span data-es>Esto es trabajo de un abogado.</span>\n          <span data-en>This is a lawyer's job.</span><span data-ht>Sa a se travay yon avoka.</span>\n        </h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li><span data-es>NO damos asesoría legal de ningún tipo.</span><span data-en>We do NOT give legal advice of any kind.</span><span data-ht>Nou PA bay konsèy legal nan okenn fason.</span></li>\n          <li><span data-es>NO le decimos si o cuándo presentar.</span><span data-en>We do NOT tell you whether or when to file.</span><span data-ht>Nou PA di w si oswa kilè pou depoze.</span></li>\n          <li><span data-es>NO seleccionamos sus motivos legales — usted marca las casillas.</span><span data-en>We do NOT pick your legal grounds — you check the boxes.</span><span data-ht>Nou PA chwazi rezon legal ou yo — ou menm ki tcheke kazye yo.</span></li>\n          <li><span data-es>NO escribimos memorandos legales ni argumentos.</span><span data-en>We do NOT write legal memos or arguments.</span><span data-ht>Nou PA ekri memo legal oswa agiman.</span></li>\n          <li><span data-es>NO aparecemos en la corte ni firmamos por usted.</span><span data-en>We do NOT appear in court or sign for you.</span><span data-ht>Nou PA parèt nan tribinal ni siyen pou ou.</span></li>\n          <li><span data-es>NO hablamos con jueces, secretarios, ni el otro lado.</span><span data-en>We do NOT speak with judges, clerks, or the other side.</span><span data-ht>Nou PA pale ak jij, grefye, oswa lòt pati a.</span></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- WHY THE FORM ITSELF IS DESIGNED FOR PEOPLE WITHOUT A LAWYER -->\n    <div class=\"nlf-explainer\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"nlf-explainer-tag\">\n          <span data-es>El formulario lo dice</span>\n          <span data-en>The form says so</span><span data-ht>Fòm nan di sa</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h3>\n          <span data-es>El Formulario AO 242 fue diseñado por la corte <em>para personas sin abogado</em>.</span>\n          <span data-en>Form AO 242 was designed by the court <em>for people without a lawyer</em>.</span><span data-ht>Fòm AO 242 te fèt pa tribinal la <em>pou moun ki pa gen avoka</em>.</span>\n        </h3>\n        <p>\n          <span data-es>Las cortes federales de los Estados Unidos publican el Formulario AO 242 gratis. Cualquier persona puede bajarlo. Las propias instrucciones del formulario le dicen al usuario que NO incluya argumentos legales en él.</span>\n          <span data-en>The U.S. Federal Courts publish Form AO 242 free. Anyone can download it. The form's own instructions tell the user NOT to include legal arguments on the form itself.</span><span data-ht>Tribinal Federal Etazini yo pibliye Fòm AO 242 gratis. Nenpòt moun ka telechaje l. Enstriksyon fòm nan li menm di itilizatè a pou PA mete agiman legal sou fòm nan.</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"pull\">\n          <span data-es>\"Conteste todas las preguntas. No necesita citar la ley… Si quiere presentar argumentos legales, debe presentarlos en un memorando aparte.\" — y para los motivos: \"Hechos de respaldo (Sea breve. No cite casos ni la ley).\"</span>\n          <span data-en>\"Answer all the questions. You do not need to cite law… If you want to submit any legal arguments, you must submit them in a separate memorandum.\" — and for the grounds: \"Supporting facts (Be brief. Do not cite cases or law.)\"</span><span data-ht>\"Reponn tout kesyon yo. Ou pa bezwen site lalwa… Si ou vle prezante agiman legal, ou dwe soumèt yo nan yon memorandòm separe.\" — epi pou rezon yo: \"Faktè ki sipòte yo (Fè kout. Pa site ka oswa lalwa.)\"</span>\n          <cite>Form AO 242 · Official Instructions · U.S. Courts</cite>\n        </div>\n        <p>\n          <span data-es>Por eso lo que tecleamos en el formulario son <strong>solo hechos</strong> — su nombre, su cumpleaños, dónde está detenido, cuándo fue detenido — y casillas que <strong>USTED</strong> marca. No hay argumento legal que escribir. El formulario no lo permite.</span>\n          <span data-en>That is why what we type onto the form is <strong>only facts</strong> — your name, your date of birth, where you are held, when you were taken — and boxes <strong>YOU</strong> check. There is no legal argument to write. The form does not allow one.</span><span data-ht>Se poutèt sa sa nou tape sou fòm nan se <strong>sèlman faktè</strong> — non w, dat nesans ou, kote w detni, kilè yo te pran w — ak kazye <strong>OU</strong> tcheke. Pa gen okenn agiman legal pou ekri. Fòm nan pa pèmèt sa.</span>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ROLES -->\n    <div class=\"nlf-roles\">\n      <h3>\n        <span data-es>Quién hace <em>qué</em>.</span>\n        <span data-en>Who does <em>what</em>.</span><span data-ht>Ki moun ki fè <em>kisa</em>.</span>\n      </h3>\n      <p>\n        <span data-es>Cada paso le pertenece a una persona. Esta lista importa, porque solo un abogado puede dar consejo, y solo USTED puede decidir entregar.</span>\n        <span data-en>Each step belongs to one person. This list matters, because only a lawyer can give advice, and only YOU can decide to file.</span><span data-ht>Chak etap apatni a yon moun. Lis sa a enpòtan, paske se sèlman yon avoka ki ka bay konsèy, epi se sèlman OU ki ka deside depoze.</span>\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"nlf-roles-grid\">\n        <div class=\"nlf-role\">\n          <div class=\"who\"><span data-es>USTED</span><span data-en>YOU</span><span data-ht>OU</span></div>\n          <div class=\"what\"><span data-es>Decide qué formulario presentar.</span><span data-en>Decide which form to file.</span><span data-ht>Deside ki fòm pou depoze.</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"nlf-role\">\n          <div class=\"who\"><span data-es>USTED</span><span data-en>YOU</span><span data-ht>OU</span></div>\n          <div class=\"what\"><span data-es>Marca las casillas de los motivos.</span><span data-en>Check the boxes for the grounds.</span><span data-ht>Tcheke kazye yo pou rezon yo.</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"nlf-role\">\n          <div class=\"who\"><span data-es>USTED</span><span data-en>YOU</span><span data-ht>OU</span></div>\n          <div class=\"what\"><span data-es>Da los hechos. Firma el formulario. Lo entrega al juez.</span><span data-en>Give the facts. Sign the form. File it with the judge.</span><span data-ht>Bay faktè yo. Siyen fòm nan. Depoze l bay jij la.</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"nlf-role\">\n          <div class=\"who\"><span data-es>NOSOTROS</span><span data-en>WE</span><span data-ht>NOU</span></div>\n          <div class=\"what\"><span data-es>Traducimos. Tecleamos. Enviamos. Nada más.</span><span data-en>Translate. Type. Mail. Nothing more.</span><span data-ht>Tradui. Tape. Voye. Anyen lòt.</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"nlf-role\">\n          <div class=\"who\"><span data-es>UN ABOGADO</span><span data-en>A LAWYER</span><span data-ht>YON AVOKA</span></div>\n          <div class=\"what\"><span data-es>Le da consejo. Escribe el memorando legal. Habla por usted en la corte.</span><span data-en>Gives you advice. Writes the legal memo. Speaks for you in court.</span><span data-ht>Ba w konsèy. Ekri memo legal la. Pale pou ou nan tribinal la.</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"nlf-role\">\n          <div class=\"who\"><span data-es>EL JUEZ</span><span data-en>THE JUDGE</span><span data-ht>JIJ LA</span></div>\n          <div class=\"what\"><span data-es>Lee su petición. Decide su caso.</span><span data-en>Reads your petition. Decides your case.</span><span data-ht>Li petisyon w. Deside ka w.</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- IF YOU NEED A LAWYER -->\n    <div class=\"nlf-ifneed\">\n      <div class=\"nlf-ifneed-tag\">\n        <span data-es>Si necesita un abogado</span>\n        <span data-en>If you need a lawyer</span><span data-ht>Si ou bezwen yon avoka</span>\n      </div>\n      <h3>\n        <span data-es>Quien enfrenta detención debe hablar con un abogado de verdad.</span>\n        <span data-en>Anyone facing detention should talk to a real lawyer.</span><span data-ht>Nenpòt moun k ap fè fas ak detansyon ta dwe pale ak yon vrè avoka.</span>\n      </h3>\n      <p>\n        <span data-es>Nuestro plan pone los primeros papeles ante un juez federal mientras la familia busca abogado. NO reemplaza al abogado. Estos son lugares para empezar a buscar — la mayoría son gratis o de bajo costo.</span>\n        <span data-en>Our plan gets the first papers in front of a federal judge while your family looks for a lawyer. It does NOT replace a lawyer. Here are places to start — most are free or low cost.</span><span data-ht>Plan nou an mete premye papye yo devan yon jij federal pandan fanmi w ap chèche yon avoka. Li PA ranplase yon avoka. Men kèk kote pou kòmanse — pifò gratis oswa pri ba.</span>\n      </p>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>Immigration Advocates Network</strong> — immigrationadvocates.org/legaldirectory</li>\n        <li><strong>EOIR Pro Bono List</strong> — justice.gov/eoir/list-pro-bono-legal-service-providers-map</li>\n        <li><strong>AILA Lawyer Search</strong> — ailalawyer.com</li>\n        <li><strong>Florida</strong> — Americans for Immigrant Justice · aijustice.org</li>\n        <li><strong>California</strong> — CHIRLA · chirla.org</li>\n        <li><strong>Texas</strong> — RAICES · raicestexas.org</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- CTA BAND -->\n<section class=\"cta-band\">\n  <h2>\n    <span data-es>$199 hoy, o <em>$10,000 mañana</em>.</span>\n    <span data-en>$199 today, or <em>$10,000 tomorrow</em>.</span><span data-ht>$199 jodi a, oswa <em>$10,000 demen</em>.</span>\n  </h2>\n  <p>\n    <span data-es>El plan vive en su teléfono. Su familia puede respirar. El martes por la mañana ya no es una crisis.</span>\n    <span data-en>The plan stays on your phone. Your family can breathe. Tuesday morning is no longer a crisis.</span><span data-ht>Plan an rete sou telefòn ou. Fanmi w ka respire. Madi maten an pa yon kriz ankò.</span>\n  </p>\n  <a href=\"#precio\" class=\"btn-primary\">\n    <span data-es>Empezar mi plan — $199</span><span data-en>Start my plan — $199</span><span data-ht>Kòmanse plan mwen — $199</span>\n    <span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\n  </a>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FOOTER -->\n<footer>\n  <div class=\"footer-grid\">\n    <div>\n      <h6>DetencionDefensa.com, Inc.</h6>\n      <p style=\"line-height:1.7;\">\n        <span data-es>Una corporación de Nevada</span><span data-en>A Nevada corporation</span><span data-ht>Yon kòporasyon Nevada</span><br>\n        9550 S. Eastern Ave, Ste 253-1056<br>\n        Las Vegas, NV 89123<br><br>\n        <strong style=\"color:var(--gold);\">NOT A LAW FIRM</strong>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <h6><span data-es>Producto</span><span data-en>Product</span><span data-ht>Pwodwi</span></h6>\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"#precio\"><span data-es>Cómo funciona</span><span data-en>How it works</span><span data-ht>Kijan li mache</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#app\">SEND DOCS</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#precio\"><span data-es>Precio</span><span data-en>Price</span><span data-ht>Pri</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#preguntas\">FAQ</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#not-law-firm\"><span data-es>NO somos abogados</span><span data-en>Not a Law Firm</span><span data-ht>Pa avoka</span></a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <h6>Legal</h6>\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"#\"><span data-es>Acuerdo del cliente</span><span data-en>Customer agreement</span><span data-ht>Akò kliyan</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#\"><span data-es>Privacidad</span><span data-en>Privacy</span><span data-ht>Vi prive</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#\"><span data-es>Términos</span><span data-en>Terms</span><span data-ht>Tèm</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#\"><span data-es>Reembolsos</span><span data-en>Refunds</span><span data-ht>Ranbousman</span></a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <h6><span data-es>Contacto</span><span data-en>Contact</span><span data-ht>Kontak</span></h6>\n      <ul>\n        <li>702-553-1790</li>\n        <li>proseforms@atomicmail.io</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer-disclaimer\">\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n      <strong>NOT A LAW FIRM · NO LEGAL ADVICE · YOU SIGN · YOU FILE.</strong>\n      <span data-es>DetencionDefensa.com, Inc. NO es un bufete de abogados, NO da asesoría legal, NO recomienda si o cuándo presentar, NO aparece en corte, y NO se comunica con ningún juez, secretario, ni parte contraria. Nuestro rol está limitado a actividades ministeriales: traducir las respuestas factuales suministradas por el cliente, mecanografiarlas en el Formulario AO 242 (28 U.S.C. § 2241 petición de habeas corpus) y en la solicitud de exención de costos in forma pauperis — ambos formularios publicados gratis por las cortes de los EE. UU. — proporcionar la app móvil que almacena el formulario en el teléfono del cliente, borrar la información personal del cliente de nuestros servidores después de la preparación, y enviar — solo si el cliente activa el plan — el formulario preparado junto con formularios en blanco, ejemplos y un sobre prepagado, para que el cliente complete cualquier entrada final, firme y presente la petición pro se. El cliente solo selecciona qué formulario presentar, completa cualquier entrada final, firma y envía. El cliente debe consultar con un abogado licenciado en su jurisdicción si enfrenta detención. Los resultados pasados no garantizan resultados futuros.</span>\n      <span data-en>DetencionDefensa.com, Inc. is NOT a law firm, does NOT give legal advice, does NOT recommend whether or when to file, does NOT appear in court, and does NOT communicate with any judge, clerk, or opposing party. Our role is strictly limited to ministerial activities: translating customer-supplied factual answers, typing them onto Form AO 242 (28 U.S.C. § 2241 petition for writ of habeas corpus) and the in forma pauperis fee-waiver application — both forms supplied free by the U.S. District Courts — providing the mobile application that stores the prepared form on the customer's own phone, scrubbing the customer's personal information from our servers after preparation, and mailing — only upon the customer's own activation of the plan — the prepared form together with blank forms, samples, and a postage-paid return envelope, so the customer can complete any final entries, sign, and file the petition pro se. The customer alone selects which form to file, completes any final entries, signs, and mails. Anyone facing detention should consult licensed counsel in their jurisdiction. Past results do not guarantee future outcomes.</span><span data-ht>DetencionDefensa.com, Inc. PA yon kabinè avoka, PA bay konsèy legal, PA rekòmande si oswa kilè pou depoze, PA parèt nan tribinal, epi PA kominike avèk okenn jij, grefye, oswa pati ki opoze. Wòl nou estriktiman limite a aktivite ministeryèl: tradui repons faktyèl kliyan an bay yo, tape yo sou Fòm AO 242 (28 U.S.C. § 2241 petisyon pou ekri habeas corpus) ak aplikasyon in forma pauperis pou egzansyon frè — toude fòm yo bay gratis pa Tribinal Distri Etazini yo — bay aplikasyon mobil ki estoke fòm prepare a sou telefòn pwòp kliyan an, efase enfòmasyon pèsonèl kliyan an nan sèvè nou apre preparasyon, epi voye nan lapòs — sèlman lè kliyan an aktive plan an pou kont li — fòm prepare a ansanm avèk fòm vid, egzanp, ak yon anvlòp retounen ki gen tenm peye, pou kliyan an ka konplete nenpòt antre final, siyen, epi depoze petisyon an pro se. Kliyan an pou kont li chwazi ki fòm pou depoze, konplete nenpòt antre final, siyen, epi voye nan lapòs. Nenpòt moun k ap fè fas ak detansyon ta dwe konsilte avoka ki gen lisans nan jiridiksyon yo. Rezilta pase pa garanti rezilta nan lavni.</span>\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <span data-es>Aclaración sobre la naturaleza del formulario: El Formulario AO 242 <strong>no</strong> se presenta en la corte de inmigración y <strong>no</strong> impugna ninguna decisión migratoria. Es una petición presentada en una corte federal de distrito de los Estados Unidos bajo 28 U.S.C. § 2241, que invoca el writ de habeas corpus — uno de los writs más antiguos del derecho angloamericano, protegido por el Artículo I, Sección 9 de la Constitución de los Estados Unidos — y se presenta pro se por el peticionario.</span>\n      <span data-en>Clarification regarding the nature of the form: Form AO 242 is <strong>not</strong> filed in immigration court and does <strong>not</strong> challenge any immigration decision. It is a petition filed in a U.S. federal district court under 28 U.S.C. § 2241, invoking the writ of habeas corpus — among the oldest writs in Anglo-American law, protected by Article I, Section 9 of the U.S. Constitution — filed pro se by the petitioner.</span><span data-ht>Klarifikasyon sou nati fòm nan: Fòm AO 242 <strong>pa</strong> depoze nan tribinal imigrasyon epi <strong>li pa</strong> konteste okenn desizyon sou imigrasyon. Se yon petisyon ki depoze nan yon tribinal distri federal Etazini dapre 28 U.S.C. § 2241, ki envoke writ habeas corpus la — youn nan writ ki pi ansyen nan lwa anglo-ameriken, ki pwoteje pa Atik I, Seksyon 9 nan Konstitisyon Etazini — depoze pro se pa petisyonè a.</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer-bottom\">\n    <span>© 2026 DetencionDefensa.com, Inc. · <span data-es>Todos los derechos reservados</span><span data-en>All rights reserved</span><span data-ht>Tout dwa rezève</span></span>\n    <span>detenciondefensa.com</span>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n";
